](/assets/icons/users-primary.svg)\n![blogs-primary](/assets/icons/blogs-primary.svg)\n![pressmentions-primary](/assets/icons/pressmentions-primary.svg)\n![phone-primary](/assets/icons/phone-primary.svg)\n![filters-primary](/assets/icons/filters-primary.svg)\n![bookmark-mobile](/assets/icons/bookmark-mobile.svg)\n\n# Projects by Vinod Jain Developer in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![search-icon](/assets/icons/search-icon.svg)\n![search-secondary](/assets/icons/search-secondary.svg)\n![near-by-locality-primary](/assets/icons/near-by-locality-primary.svg)\n\n### Locations in Malabar Hill\n\nExplore these locations based on your search.\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n![Property image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vinod-jain-developer-vinod-36-babulnath-location-map-1688543259.webp)\n![Property image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vinod-jain-developer-vinod-36-babulnath-swimming-pool-1688543300.webp)\n![Property image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vinod-jain-developer-vinod-36-babulnath-elevation-1688543172.webp)\n![Property image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vinod-jain-developer-vinod-36-babulnath-elevation-1688543205.webp)\n![Property image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vinod-jain-developer-vinod-36-babulnath-elevation-1688543355.webp)\n![Property image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/vinod-jain-developer-vinod-36-babulnath-elevation-1688543205.webp)\n\n## Vinod 36 Babulnath\n\n## ₹7.75 Cr - 10 Cr\n\n![share-secondary](/assets/icons/share-secondary.svg)\n\n36 BABULNATH With an unbeatable location, genteel environs, thoughtful amenities and perfectly designed homes, this is an opportunity to create your own blissful space in a charming old neighbourhood, especially when development is scarce and hard to come by. Wake up to the tolls of bells from the temple. Use the extensive exercising facilities within, or go for a brisk walk or jog on Marine Drive. Tackle the day with the gusto. And unwind to some of the best views of South Mumbai. It’s satisfying when all things fall into place. Just like they have at 36 Babulnath. It is conveniently located in the proximity of prominent places of worship, as also hallowed temples of learning. For work or shopping, the corporate hubs and office districts are a short drive away, as are all the old markets and best of new malls. Stunning and unrestricted views of Hanging Gardens and Marine Drive makes staying and working from home a delightful option, should you choose to. A life in your own luxurious abode, high above it all.\n\n## Properties for sale in Mumbai\n\n## Other Developers in Malabar Hill\n\n## Vinod Jain Developer Projects in Mumbai by Possession\n\n## Vinod Jain Developer Projects in Mumbai by Configuration\n\n## Vinod Jain Developer Projects in Mumbai\n\n## Vinod Jain Developer Projects in Mumbai by Budget\n\n### OVERVIEW\n\n### EXPLORE\n\nReferral\n\n### CITIES WE SERVE\n\n### FOLLOW US\n\n![facebook-primary](/assets/icons/facebook-primary.svg)\n![instagram-primary](/assets/icons/instagram-primary.svg)\n![linkedin-primary](/assets/icons/linkedin-primary.svg)\n![twitter-x-primary](/assets/icons/twitter-x-primary.svg)\n![youtube-primary](/assets/icons/youtube-primary.svg)\n![mail-primary](/assets/icons/mail-primary.svg)\n\n© Copyright 2026 Blox.xyz","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.proptiger.com/mumbai/babulnath-road/vinod-mohanlal-jain-36-babulnath-1778498","title":"Vinod 36 Babulnath in Babulnath Road, Mumbai - Price, Location Map, Floor Plan & Reviews :PropTiger.com","raw_content":"India's best property portal to buy property in India - Proptiger.com\n\nLogin to get a more personalised experience\n\nHi  there!\n\nNo recently viewed properties yet. Start exploring homes you like!\n\n[Explore projects](/all-projects)\n\n[See all recently viewed properties](/recentlyViewed)\n\nNo Enquired properties yet. Start exploring homes you like!\n\n[Explore projects](/all-projects)\n\nYou need to login to see all your enquired properties.\n\n[See all 