abar Hill\\*\\* 36 Babulnath is a new luxury residential project by reputed developer Vinod Mohanlal Jain. Located in the heart of Malabar Hill, this project offers 3 BHK homes with carpet areas ranging from 1116 ft to 1116 ft. The project is surrounded by all the amenities you need for a comfortable life, including schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and restaurants. It is also close to the city's best beaches and parks. The homes at 36 Babulnath are designed to offer the ultimate in luxury and comfort. They feature spacious layouts, high-quality finishes, and state-of-the-art amenities. The project also has a number of security features, including 24/7 security guards and CCTV cameras. If you are looking for a luxurious and comfortable home in Malabar Hill, then 36 Babulnath is the perfect place for you. Contact us today to learn more about the project and to schedule a viewing.\n\nRead More\n\nVIEW DETAILS\n\nENQUIRE NOW](/view/vinod-36-babulnath-by-vinod-mohanlal-jain-at-malabar-hill_0f22ce07-ceac-408f-a9a7-beea77d0ce11)\n\n# explore further\n\n### property for sale by Developer\n\n[2 BHK Homes in Malabar Hill by Radius Developers](/projects/2-bhk-homes-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-by-radius-developers)[2 BHK Homes in Malabar Hill by Divine Realty](/projects/2-bhk-homes-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-by-divine-realty)[2 BHK Homes in Malabar Hill by Rohan Lifescapes](/projects/2-bhk-homes-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-by-rohan-lifescapes)[2 BHK Homes in Malabar Hill by NHP Group](/projects/2-bhk-homes-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-by-nhp-group)\n\n### Resources\n\n[Converters](/converters)[Knowledge Base](/news)[Pin code](/pin-code)\n\n[Vinod 36 Babulnath Story](/amp/project_story/vinod-36-babulnath-by-vinod-mohanlal-jain-at-malabar-hill_0f22ce07-ceac-408f-a9a7-beea77d0ce11)\n\napply for home loan\n\nReady to apply for home loan ?\n\nSpecialized Home Loan Offers\n\nDwello customers getextra 33% off on Mortgage Origination Fee from Bajaj Housing Finance\n\nLowest Interest Rate\n\nNo Hidden C